WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.890
Dammit. Where'd they go?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.890
Find them. They can't have made it far.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.820
Keep quiet, dummy.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.600
It's all right. Don't cry.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.770
But...

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.230
I'm here now, so you're safe! So...

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.620
Don't be scared, okay?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.900
Besides, I thought you were 
good at hide-and-seek.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.880
Okay? Make sure they don't find you.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:33.940
Okay.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.190
Oh...

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:37.690
Misha!

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.530
Be safe, everyone.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:46.920
Don't go!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.940
There! It's her!

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.510
Don't let her get away!

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.320
You have to live!

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.180
We're falling back.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.840
This is Yato. Amiya...

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:43.120
<i>That's two ambushers down.</i>

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.180
Understood.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.590
Doctor, the enemy has been suppressed.

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:48.640
Got it.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:54.440
Franka.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.400
All right, got 'em.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.280
Doctor, are you okay?

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.450
I'm fine.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.290
Thanks a lot.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.750
Liskarm and Franka.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.520
Don't mention it. This is normal work for 
Blacksteel. If you need anything, just ask.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:15.790
Try not to boss us around too much, though.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:18.690
"Blacksteel"?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:22.230
Oh, I haven't told you, have I?

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:25.800
They aren't Rhodes Island Operators.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:30.270
They work for Blacksteel 
Worldwide, an international PMC.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:35.810
They have a partnership with Rhodes Island,
 and often come along with us on operations.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.940
Amiya, are you sure you have enough time?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.030
Ah, this is bad!

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.200
We should hurry!

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:56.930
Don't move.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.090
Let go!

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.130
We haven't done anything!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:03.090
Shut up. You're being 
refused entry into Lungmen.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.450
Go back the way you came.

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.550
Dammit.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:10.820
You want me to go back to the wastes?!
 How heartless can you be?!

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.160
Grab him!

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.060
Stop that!

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:19.530
Can't you hear me? Hey!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.480
Stop that right now, Infected!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.110
Stay where you are!

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.430
You little...

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.080
Take them in.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:41.780
Help us... We don't have anywhere else to go.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.670
Help us, please!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.100
Don't you have any compassion?! Hey!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:52.460
Inspector Ch'en.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.200
This is a disgrace on L.G.D.'s name.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.450
I'm really sorry!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.540
Make sure it doesn't happen again.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.320
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.310
Madame Ch'en, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.280
I was told the meeting would be at 2200.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.240
Rhodes Island can't even be punctual, huh?

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.400
I'm sorry.

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.390
Hmph. Who's this?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.220
This is the Doctor, 
a consultant from Rhodes Island.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.300
This way, then.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.220
Amiya, we'll take our leave now.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.320
We need to debrief our superiors.

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.230
See ya, little bunny.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.270
Okay. See you.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.020
Let's go, Doctor.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:41.290
Going up.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:41.860
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.110
Lungmen Underground

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.460
Wow!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.750
I've never seen buildings this tall.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:11.900
Doctor, look! Over there...

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.020
Um, I'm sorry.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:22.860
We know the gist of 
what happened in Chernobog.

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:28.490
The survivors are pouring into Lungmen, 
and there are Infected hiding among them.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.700
It's pointless to seek our help.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:37.710
Why... go so far to reject the Infected?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.620
It's for the safety of our citizens.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:07.080
Chief Wei, the Rhodes Island 
representatives are here.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.280
Good work.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.790
Amiya.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:19.630
Dr. Kal'tsit.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:23.870
Doctor? You came along, too?

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:26.990
Take a seat.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.130
R-Right.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.360
Well, then. Please continue, Miss Kal'tsit.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:36.890
Given the situation, I'm sure you 
should already be well aware.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:43.580
Quarantining the Infected won't keep the 
impending Reunion threat out of your city.

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:50.920
If Lungmen continues to rely 
on its existing Infected policies,

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.160
the losses suffered at 
Reunion's hands will be immense.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.320
Oh?

00:07:55.320 --> 00:08:00.770
We've already made preparations 
in anticipation of a Reunion attack.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:03.370
Your concern is unnecessary.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:09.600
Has Lungmen ever been in a conflict 
with a group of Infected insurgents?

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.410
It's a good thing to have a contingency 
for an attack you anticipate.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:17.480
However, if you're planning on 
letting them make the first move,

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.590
I must say you're extraordinarily 
naïve, Miss Ch'en.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:25.020
Are you implying the Lungmen Guard 
Department is no match for an Infected group?!

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.440
And what makes you think Reunion 
has their sights set on Lungmen?

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:36.600
To expand their influence, they need more 
than just resources. They need recruits, too.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:40.170
In other words, the Infected.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.780
Here, they can get large amounts
 of both in one fell swoop.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:50.700
To Reunion, there might be 
no better target than Lungmen.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.360
I can't deny that.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:09:00.850
Rhodes Island has learned a thing or two from our 
run-in with Reunion. We can offer you advice, Mr. Wei.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.600
Advice, huh?

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:12.360
Your offer is a contract. You're not offering 
advice out of the goodness of your hearts.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:17.120
If you are looking to secure this 
contract and form a partnership,

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:22.320
shouldn't you first offer us information
 that might benefit us, Miss Kal'tsit?

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.370
I mean no offense when I say this,

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.260
but the knowledge and intelligence 
we obtained from our battle in Chernobog

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:32.000
are all rooted in Rhodes Island's 
actual combat experience.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.880
Without our involvement, it won't be useful.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:38.800
Lungmen has no choice 
but to sign this agreement,

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:42.310
and take on the Reunion threat with us.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.390
Oh?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:49.440
Chief Wei! We cannot allow these Infected 
outsiders to meddle in our affairs!

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.680
Calm down. They're our guests.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:53.760
But...

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:56.820
"When I choose who to fight alongside...

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:59.530
I care about one thing only."

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:03.910
"And that is whether they have 
the strength to stand with me."

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.180
What's this?

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:13.750
The records of your battles with 
Reunion prior to your arrival here.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:18.290
Officer Ch'en, what is your opinion of 
Rhodes Island's combat capabilities?

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:19.930
Their vanguard and rearguard

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.110
and their response to the terrain 
and enemy positioning are satisfactory.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:28.240
And with their combat prowess, 
they definitely earn a passing grade.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:33.150
That said, if this is all they've got, there's no 
reason for us to seek Rhodes Island's help.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:37.800
The L.G.D. is more than capable of dealing 
with this problem ourselves. That's how I see it.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:38.840
I agree.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:44.530
The Lungmen Guard Department can 
easily extinguish this Reunion threat.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.450
Besides...

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:53.370
What you're asking for in exchange 
is too dear a price, Miss Kal'tsit.

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:59.470
I'll say this again, but Reunion
 are more than just rioters.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.270
If you don't take the initiative and 
make appropriate plans immediately,

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:06.300
Lungmen will fall in a matter of weeks.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.390
Is that your idea of a threat?

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.260
What kind of proof do you even—

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.810
We saw her.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.670
Amiya?

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:19.320
The one burning everything all across the
 land with the raging anger of the Infected...

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:20.830
The tyrant.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.990
Reunion's leader.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:33.130
Are you telling me... 
you met Reunion's leader?

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:35.270
The Draco girl, huh?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.630
What was her name again?

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:39.590
Talulah.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.220
Right, that's it.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:47.720
Chernobog fell in one night because Reunion 
chose to act on the day of a Catastrophe,

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:51.210
and because Talulah herself 
participated in the operation.

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:52.100
What?

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:56.440
Reunion turned Infected 
anger into a raging fire

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:00.610
that brought down Chernobog, an Ursus city.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:06.620
And to expand their influence, 
they have their sights set on Lungmen.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:11.250
They won't stop... no matter the cost.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:17.250
The Reunion matter aside, there is 
one other thing we are worried about.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:22.420
The Ursus Empire's next move,
 now that they've lost Chernobog.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.090
Do you understand my meaning?

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.620
Yes.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.270
You are right, Rhodes Island.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:38.740
Very well. I will follow your advice, 
and sign this agreement with you.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:39.610
Chief Wei!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:45.410
That said, getting what you're asking 
for depends on how well you do.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:47.740
I have two conditions.

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:55.000
First, Rhodes Island must assist us in totally
 eradicating the Reunion threat to Lungmen.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:59.670
As for the second, we'll talk about that 
once you are done with the first condition.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.250
That's...

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.920
If you can't accept that, 
then the contract is void.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.260
It seems Rhodes Island 
doesn't have much choice, either.

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.260
Chief Wei, if possible...

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.360
I'd like to add an extra 
stipulation in the contract.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.630
And what might that be, miss?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:24.400
"Any interpretation of the clauses 
must be agreed upon by both parties."

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:26.780
Would that be okay?

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:29.780
Of course.

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:34.940
This stipulation shows 
your respect for Lungmen.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.820
Congratulations, dear guests.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.550
Lungmen's doors are now open to you.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.150
I welcome you.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.960
I was so nervous.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.000
Good work.

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:55.310
We can't let our guard down yet.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:58.160
This is Wei the Cunning we're talking about.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.210
Who knows what he's planning.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:06.470
That said, it's quite an achievement 
to sign a contract with a man like him.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.120
You did very well 
negotiating with him, Amiya.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.040
Dr. Kal'tsit...

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.290
Our first time meeting, yet no greeting?

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:27.660
Dr. Kal'tsit, please don't 
tease the Doctor too much.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.890
I only hope that the sacrifices 
we made will be worthwhile.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.550
Welcome back, Doctor.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:42.900
It's good to see you back.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.770
The place Madame Ch'en 
told us to investigate is nearby.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:50.950
It's very likely Reunion 
fighters are hiding here,

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:54.350
after entering the city with the refugees.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.370
We might find ourselves 
drawn into battle at any time.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.960
So please don't leave my side, okay?

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.820
Doctor?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:08.950
This way.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.720
Ah, wait!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:13.600
Hey, where'd she go?

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:17.800
You were just with her. Spill it.

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.020
Let me go.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.440
Let go, asshole!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.900
Tsk. Little prick.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.240
Huh?

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.030
What's this?

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.300
Who are you people?

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.880
You know this punk?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.210
Huh?

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.180
What—

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:50.510
This is your only warning.

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:52.970
Leave this place immediately.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.200
Sh-She knows how to use A-Arts?!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.970
I didn't sign up for this!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.100
S-Stay back, you monster!

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:03.860
Amiya...

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.610
I'm used to it already.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.750
Never mind me. We need to treat them.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.140
There we go. All better now.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.160
Thanks.

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:20.770
A doll?

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:24.980
It's a teddy bear!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.000
Misha made us this!

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:30.120
Misha?

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.340
Yep! She said it was a lucky charm!

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.500
It's cute.

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.100
Bunny lady!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.980
Help Misha, please!

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:44.040
There are bad guys chasing Misha.

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:47.780
She said we'd be in danger 
if we stayed together...

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.110
She's on the run alone right now!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.010
She's being chased?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.770
Maybe those men just now?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.110
It sounds like there's more to this.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.950
Okay. We'll look for Misha.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.000
Really?!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.500
Yep, so don't worry.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.870
It won't be good if you get caught up 
in that again, so I'll take you home first.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.380
We don't have a home.

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:11.600
What?

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.590
We just sleep wherever.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.340
Oh, we don't have parents, either.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.260
It's fine, though.

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.190
We'll hide real good. They won't find us.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.320
But they found us just now.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:26.030
Th-That's true, but it'll be fine this time.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.140
We promised Misha, after all.

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:32.110
Misha...

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.820
I wanna see her.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.950
We'll help her, for sure.

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:41.700
Could you tell me what Misha looks like?

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:44.700
Undocumented Infected, huh?

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:47.360
It'll take some work to find them.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:51.420
What can you do? They hide in places
where it's easiest to escape being found.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:57.700
I never thought we'd end up following 
the Monster Inspector's orders.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.150
Yes, this is Liskarm.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.680
It's Officer Ch'en.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.520
Oh, yikes, did she hear that?

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.850
We're currently patrolling 
Point B in the slums.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:11.020
Yes... Yes.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.610
A search mission, then?

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.110
Understood. What's the target's name?

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:17.110
"Misha," is it?

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.070
Okay. Yes, understood.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.880
We'll bring her in as soon as we find her.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:23.740
Wait a moment!

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:27.000
Liskarm, may I talk to her?

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:31.010
<i>Madame Ch'en, can you hear me? It's Amiya.</i>

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:31.750
Affirmative.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.160
Please tell me the reason behind this search.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.980
<i>You don't need to know. Now see to it.</i>

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:38.880
Um...

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:41.340
She hung up.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.160
Don't mind her, little bunny.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:48.490
Anyway, taking this person 
into custody is our top priority.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:52.030
Right. I'll let Rhodes 
Island's recon team know.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.080
Please come with us.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.190
Okay!

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:59.000
Now, as for the search target's features...

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:04.170
She's a white-haired Ursus girl, 
and she's about 145 cm tall.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.730
Huh? How did you...

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:11.750
Well, you see, protecting her
 is our top priority.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.880
Found her!

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.340
Over here!

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:49.640
Amiya.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:54.210
Are you Misha?

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.000
O-Oh, wait!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.840
We're here to protect you!

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:06.550
I'm Amiya, and I work for 
Rhodes Island Pharmaceuticals.

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:08.610
Rhodes Island?

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:12.740
We're an organization that 
helps Infected like you.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:16.010
How do you know I'm infected?!

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:20.980
Misha. You're being followed, aren't you?

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.620
We'll take you somewhere safe.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:25.840
You're lying.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:28.580
You're going to bring me in
 and lock me up, aren't you?

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.160
No, that's not what we're—

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.370
Stay away!

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:35.960
I know how the Infected are treated here!

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:40.530
Misha, we're really trying to help you.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:43.480
Who'd believe that?!

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:44.220
"Help me"?

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.530
Help me how?

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:48.280
It's not that simple!

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:52.120
If we were gonna bring you in, 
we would've done it long ago.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.080
Hey...

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.620
You're... infected, too?

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:03.780
Yes.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.110
Just like you.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.870
Why are you helping me?

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:16.040
Because your friends 
asked me to help you.

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.490
Are they all right?!

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:20.130
They're okay.

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.640
Thank goodness.

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:30.500
That said, if you stay on the run, 
those kids might find themselves in danger.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:31.760
Are you okay with that?

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:38.270
We want to protect you and your friends.

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:40.770
Misha.

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:44.940
Please, come with us.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.240
All right. I'll come with you.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:55.620
Thanks...

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:56.860
Misha.
